message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below, and cite Lavi's preprint for the mathematics and RealRooted for the formalization of Gurvits's argument."
type: software
title: "Lean 4 formalization of Lavi's proof of Foregger's conjecture"
version: 1.3.1
